WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.837 --> 00:00:13.898
Chomp! Chomp!

2
00:00:14.539 --> 00:00:16.560
The robot shark shot toward Roxy.

3
00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:19.301
"Whoa!" Roxy darted to the side.

4
00:00:20.042 --> 00:00:22.003
The shark's snapping jaws just missed her.

5
00:00:23.364 --> 00:00:24.884
People on the street below pointed.

6
00:00:24.904 --> 00:00:27.266
"A flying robot shark!"

7
00:00:27.766 --> 00:00:28.466
a man cried.

8
00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:31.088
"Run!" a woman shouted.

9
00:00:32.192 --> 00:00:33.712
The shark flew at Roxy again.

10
00:00:34.413 --> 00:00:35.713
Its jaws were wide open.

11
00:00:35.733 --> 00:00:40.094
Whoosh! Roxy blew her freeze breath at the shark.

12
00:00:41.154 --> 00:00:42.635
Its jaws froze in place.

13
00:00:44.155 --> 00:00:46.376
Roxy grabbed the shark and swung it toward the ground.

14
00:00:48.216 --> 00:00:49.897
It smashed into a million pieces.

15
00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:53.218
"Now I need to catch Bonnie Bones!"

16
00:00:54.458 --> 00:00:58.619
Zoom! She spotted the pirate ship flying over Metro City Park.

17
00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.220
Roxy landed on the ship's deck.

18
00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.461
Bonnie Bones stood at the wheel.

19
00:01:04.381 --> 00:01:05.862
A big cannon sat near her.

20
00:01:05.882 --> 00:01:09.123
"Land this ship right now!"

21
00:01:09.423 --> 00:01:10.143
Roxy shouted.

22
00:01:10.163 --> 00:01:12.224
"I'm taking you to jail!"

23
00:01:12.244 --> 00:01:14.805
"Jail!" the parrot sang.

24
00:01:15.846 --> 00:01:19.887
"Arr!" Bonnie Bones pointed the cannon at Roxy and lit the fuse.

25
00:01:21.908 --> 00:01:23.989
Boom! A cannonball shot out.

26
00:01:24.689 --> 00:01:26.650
Roxy leaped forward and caught the cannonball.

27
00:01:27.451 --> 00:01:28.731
Bonnie's eyes went wide.

28
00:01:29.592 --> 00:01:34.169
"How did you Roxy rolled the cannonball back at Bonnie.

29
00:01:34.729 --> 00:01:36.030
The pirate jumped out of the way.

30
00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:39.172
Then she lit the fuse again.

31
00:01:40.232 --> 00:01:41.273
Roxy stared hard.

32
00:01:41.873 --> 00:01:44.375
Orange beams shot from her eyes and melted the cannon.

33
00:01:47.456 --> 00:01:49.738
"Arr!" Bonnie tried to run away.

34
00:01:49.758 --> 00:01:53.380
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

35
00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:56.601
Bonnie blocked the laser beams with her hook.

36
00:01:57.802 --> 00:02:00.103
The beams bounced off and hit the ship's wheel.

37
00:02:00.464 --> 00:02:08.504
Ka-boom! "Ahh!"

38
00:02:08.524 --> 00:02:11.405
Bonnie held onto a railing as the ship crash-landed in the park.

39
00:02:14.586 --> 00:02:15.746
The ship's hull broke open.

40
00:02:16.926 --> 00:02:19.187
Money from the pirates' bank robberies spilled out.

41
00:02:22.688 --> 00:02:23.488
Jack gasped.

42
00:02:23.968 --> 00:02:25.229
"Pirate treasure!"

43
00:02:25.989 --> 00:02:27.409
Mara pointed at the ship's deck.

44
00:02:27.429 --> 00:02:29.310
"Rocket Girl!"

45
00:02:32.691 --> 00:02:33.971
Roxy stood in front of Bonnie.

46
00:02:34.911 --> 00:02:36.312
The pirate looked over her shoulder.

47
00:02:37.452 --> 00:02:38.913
She was standing on the ship's plank.

48
00:02:39.753 --> 00:02:40.894
It was a long way down.

49
00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.094
Police officers waited below.

50
00:02:43.114 --> 00:02:46.796
"You have two choices," Roxy said.

51
00:02:46.816 --> 00:02:51.138
"Go to jail now—or after you walk the plank!"

52
00:02:51.158 --> 00:02:53.979
"Walk the plank!"

53
00:02:54.259 --> 00:02:55.039
the parrot sang.

54
00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:57.080
Bonnie Bones hung her head.

55
00:02:57.100 --> 00:03:00.782
"Arr. I guess we're going to jail."

56
00:03:03.943 --> 00:03:05.724
Later Roxy found her friends in the park.

57
00:03:07.132 --> 00:03:08.173
"Where were you?"

58
00:03:08.513 --> 00:03:09.214
Mara asked.

59
00:03:09.814 --> 00:03:11.776
"You missed all the excitement!"

60
00:03:11.796 --> 00:03:14.178
"Really?" Roxy asked.

61
00:03:14.198 --> 00:03:16.100
"Did you find the box?"

62
00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:19.502
"We saw something better," Jack said.

63
00:03:19.522 --> 00:03:21.224
"Pirate's treasure!"

64
00:03:22.185 --> 00:03:22.945
Terrell nodded.

65
00:03:22.965 --> 00:03:24.647
"Rocket Girl found it.

66
00:03:25.307 --> 00:03:27.529
But you probably knew that, right?"

67
00:03:27.549 --> 00:03:29.351
"Huh?" Jack said.

68
00:03:29.371 --> 00:03:31.112
"How would Roxy know that?"

69
00:03:33.174 --> 00:03:35.516
Just then Roxy spotted something under a shrub.

70
00:03:37.432 --> 00:03:38.014
"The box!"

71
00:03:39.598 --> 00:03:41.402
They ran over to see what was inside.

72
00:03:41.422 --> 00:03:44.089
"Whew," Roxy thought.

73
00:03:45.112 --> 00:03:46.495
"My secret is still safe."
